  {
   "id": 13,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    1240,
    380
   ],
   "size": [
    520,
    320
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 13,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Krea 2 Turbo img2img + Realistic Snapshot\n\n**Denoise** on the KSampler is the only knob that matters:\n- `0.35` to `0.5`: keep the composition, re-render textures and lighting (photo cleanup, realism pass).\n- `0.55` to `0.7`: same subject and layout, freer re-interpretation (default `0.6`).\n- `0.75`+: only rough colours/shapes survive; flat art or sketches need this.\n\nTurbo is distilled: keep **8 steps, cfg 1, euler / simple**. With denoise 0.6 it runs ~5 of the 8 steps.\n\n**LoRA strength** 1.5 (author: 1.0 floor, up to 2.0). No trigger word.\n\nThe input is resized to ~1 MP (multiple of 16). Change `megapixels` for larger outputs; Krea 2 Turbo is happy up to ~2 MP.\n\nDescribe the *result* in the prompt (subject + photo style), not the edit."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Notes"
  }
